# Forward guard for Speakeasy regeneration.
#
# This package no longer runs Speakeasy in CI (sdk_generation.yaml was
# removed; see also f1241ff — "we don't generate mcp server anymore").
# Keep this list anyway: if someone regenerates from a sibling tree that
# still has `.speakeasy/`, these files must not be overwritten.
#
# Speakeasy's stock `bytesToBase64` is still
#   btoa(String.fromCodePoint(...u8arr))
# which overflows the stack on any binary payload ≳128 KB. The chunked
# implementation lives in the hand-maintained helper; the two former
# generated wrappers re-export / call through it.

src/lib/bytes-to-base64.ts
src/lib/base64.ts
src/mcp-server/shared.ts
__tests__/bytesToBase64.test.ts

# Carry fixes a regeneration would silently undo: --server-url as an origin,
# an instance URL with a scheme, credential redaction in debug logs, debug
# logs on stderr (server.ts for `start`, tools.ts for `serve`), plain-language
# flag errors, and the escaped landing page origin. Every one of these was in
# the last .speakeasy/gen.lock; src/cli/ and the new helper files never were.
src/lib/config.ts
src/lib/sdks.ts
src/landing-page.ts
src/mcp-server/cli/start/command.ts
src/mcp-server/cli/serve/command.ts
src/mcp-server/server.ts
src/mcp-server/tools.ts
